<title>UK: ING Barings adds four analysts to Latam team.</title>
<headline>ING Barings adds four analysts to Latam team.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it has added four analysts to its team of Latin American analysts in New York.</p>
<p>Petru Vaduva joins as a banking analyst, Patrick Jurczak for telecommunications, Charles Barnett on electric utilities and Hector Castillo for cement and construction industries.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
</text>
